cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "IdentifyingConservationGaps: data and R code for Denmark terrestrial protection analyses (Fig. 1, Table S2)"
version: 1.0.0
license: "MIT"
type: software
abstract: "Data processing scripts and R workflows to reproduce the terrestrial analyses, Fig. 1 map, and Table S2 reported in the supplementary material for 'Identifying Conservation Gaps: A Framework for Evaluating National Contributions to the 30x30 Target'."
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata in this CITATION.cff file."
